{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209","id":1839251659,"node_id":"I_kwDOAfkRIM5toMDL","number":1209,"title":"YAML::Nodes alias rather than moving when using std::vector::erase, std::iter_swap and similar methods.","user":{"login":"riv-mjohnson","id":104826595,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj-G4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104826595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson","html_url":"https://github.com/riv-mjohnson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riv-mjohnson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2023-08-07T11:26:58Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T08:48:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The following unit test fails\r\n```\r\n#include \"gtest/gtest.h\"\r\n#include <yaml-cpp/yaml.h>\r\n#include <vector>\r\n\r\nTEST(VectorErase, ProducesVectorContainingCorrectElements) {\r\n    YAML::Node a;\r\n    a[\"name\"] = \"a\";\r\n    YAML::Node b;\r\n    b[\"name\"] = \"b\";\r\n    YAML::Node c;\r\n    c[\"name\"] = \"c\";\r\n    std::vector<YAML::Node> vec{a, b, c};\r\n    vec.erase(vec.begin());\r\n    EXPECT_EQ(vec[0][\"name\"].as<std::string>(), \"b\");\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen `vec.erase(vec.begin())` is called, instead of `vec` containing names `{\"b\", \"c\"}`, it instead contains names `{\"c\", \"c\"}`.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that this is something to do with aliasing rather than copying when the vector elements are moved. This is likely an issue with the move constructor or move assignment of the Node.\r\n\r\nI am using libcpp-yaml0.6, as I am currently limited to Ubuntu 20.04.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jbeder/yaml-cpp/issues/1209/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}